<title>USA: U.S. rice stocks in California on August 1 -- USDA. [Corrected 14:57 gmt]</title>
<headline>U.S. rice stocks in California on August 1 -- USDA. [Corrected 14:57 gmt]</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA reported U.S. rice stocks in California on August 1 (corrects from December 1) (1,000 hundred lbs):</p>
<p>			   ----ROUGH RICE----    ---MILLED RICE---</p>
<p>			   08/01/96  08/01/95    08/01/96  08/01/95</p>
<p>	     On Farm-X	100	 105	   N/A	 N/A</p>
<p>	    In Mills-X	936	 617	 1,170     1,363</p>
<p>     In Warehouses-Z    9,325     9,556	   Nil	 Nil</p>
<p> In Ports/In Transit	Nil	 Nil	   Nil	 Nil</p>
<p> Total All Positions   10,361    10,278	 1,170     1,363</p>
<p>X-Includes stocks in farm warehouses. Y-Includes stocks in attached warehouses. Z-Warehouses not attached to mills.  </p>
<p>USDA also reported rice stocks in all positions in California by quarter as follows (1,000 hundredweights):</p>
<p>		08/01/96  03/01/96 08/01/95  03/01/95</p>
<p>  ROUGH  --  10,361    24,945    10,278   27,260</p>
<p> MILLED  --   1,170	 884     1,363    1,341</p>
</text>
